hidden underwater?

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,300
Water carries sound
remarkably well.

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,433
Low-frequency sound loses
very little energy to

7
00:00:17,433 --> 00:00:20,933
