9
00:00:24,533 --> 00:00:27,633
Many submarines are wrapped
in special coatings.

10
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:29,833
Some soak up incoming sonar
pings,

11
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:33,333
so less sound echoes back.
Others muffle the noise the

12
00:00:33,333 --> 00:00:34,500
